<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Pitney Bowes.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts Pitney Bowes.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon analyst Jonathan Rosenzweig said he started Pitney Bowes Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month target price of $63-$65 per share.</p>
</text>
